{"title":"Water wheel/15","sourceTitle":"Water wheel/15/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>Cada <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Small_4-way_hub\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Small 4-way hub\">small 4-way hub</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Small_4-way_hub\" title=\"Small 4-way hub\"> </a></span> é forjado em bigorna com três lingotes de ferro, ferro meteórico ou aço. São necessários dois cubos por roda d'água, então reserve seis lingotes antes de começar. Consulte a página <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Smithing\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Smithing\">smithing</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Smithing\" title=\"Smithing\"> </a></span> para o processo geral da bigorna.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261111120738\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.003 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.003 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 43/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 348/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 138/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.930      1 -total\n 97.54%    0.907      2 Template:Ll\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wikinew-vs_:pcache:idhash:183764-0!canonical and timestamp 20261111120738 and revision id 397383. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","sections":[],"revid":397383,"sourceUrl":"https://wiki.vintagestory.at/index.php?title=Water_wheel%2F15%2Fpt-br","capturedAt":"2026-11-11T12:07:39.394Z"}